`background-color: #`

To create the desired output ("I hate humans"), you can add the following CSS code:

```css
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #;
    color: white;
    font-size: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>

<style>
  @media print {
    body {
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    }
  }
</style>

<style>
  @page {
    size: auto;
    margin: 0mm;
  }
</style>

